    "title": "Charlotte man accepts plea deal in 2023 death of ex-girlfriend Allisha Watts - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spencer Chrisman ,\n7 hours ago MONTGOMERY COUNTY, N.C. (WBTV) - A Charlotte man charged with first-degree murder in his ex-girlfriend’s 2023 death accepted a plea deal this week, court documents showed. On Wednesday, Feb. 18, James Dunmore pleaded guilty to voluntary manslaughter and failure to notify of a death in the killing of his ex-girlfriend Allisha Watts. Dunmore maintains his innocent in connection with her death, however. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
